# Build context of the backend image is the repo root (it needs db/migrations, #41).
# Never ship local secrets, tests, caches or the frontend into it.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov
backend/tests
# backend/scripts stays: the model catalog refresh runs in the container (scripts/README.md)
**/node_modules
**/.next
frontend/
docs/
scripts/
*.dump
**/.venv
.claude
.superpowers
docker-compose*.yml
*.md
